### 6. Financial Truth Engine — highest priority

Now develop:

```text
financialtruth/model/
financialtruth/enums/
financialtruth/rules/
financialtruth/calculator/
financialtruth/service/
financialtruth/repository/
financialtruth/dto/
financialtruth/controller/
```

Core classes:

```text
FinancialTruthEngine
ExpectedAmountCalculator
ActualAmountCalculator
VarianceCalculator
ImpactAggregator

FinancialRule
PricingVarianceRule
DiscountVarianceRule
RuleContext
RuleEvaluationResult
```

The engine must produce:

```text
Expected value
Actual value
Variance
Financial impact
Rule version
Calculation run
```

For example:

```text
Contract price = ₹920
Invoice price  = ₹1,000
Quantity       = 10,000

Expected = ₹92,00,000
Actual   = ₹1,00,00,000
Variance = ₹8,00,000
```

Use `BigDecimal`. No AI.

