## The actual development sequence

Don't implement every file in a folder before moving on. Build these **vertical milestones**:

```text
M1  Application foundation
 ↓
M2  Identity + tenant security
 ↓
M3  Secure CSV/XLSX ingestion
 ↓
M4  Canonical financial model
 ↓
M5  Contract/pricing model
 ↓
M6  Deterministic Financial Truth Engine
 ↓
M7  Financial regression suite
 ↓
M8  Evidence + lineage
 ↓
M9  Economic Opportunity Record
 ↓
M10 Finance investigation + validation
 ↓
M11 Action + realized-value tracking
 ↓
M12 AI assistance
 ↓
M13 Evidence-backed reporting
 ↓
M14 Async processing
 ↓
M15 Audit + observability + hardening
```

### The first complete demo you should target

```text
CSV/XLSX
   ↓
Secure ingestion
   ↓
Validation
   ↓
Canonical invoices
   +
Contract pricing
   ↓
Financial Truth Engine
   ↓
₹8,00,000 exact variance
   ↓
Evidence + lineage
   ↓
Economic Opportunity
   ↓
Finance user reviews
   ↓
Validates
   ↓
Action recorded
   ↓
Actual value recorded
```

That is the **first real Phase 0 product**. Everything else should be built around making this flow secure, deterministic, auditable, fast, and extensible toward the final Enterprise Financial & Profit Intelligence Infrastructure.
